# Cloudflare Pages reads this at the edge. Path-only matching: a rule whose
# source is a full URL is parsed and silently ignored, which is why the
# www->apex redirect is a zone-level Redirect Rule in the dashboard instead.
#
# /get is the short URL printed on the app promo card used across the blog.
# The card is a rendered image, so the URL on it cannot be edited after the
# fact the way a link in copy can — this redirect is what keeps it true.
/get  /download  301
